C PAION2 [MW/m#3]   D-T Fraction of fusion alpha power deposited to ions
C     P.Pavlo  22.06.89/A.Polevoi 20-MAY-94
        y2 = 88./TE(J)
        y = sqrt(y2)
        PAION2    = 2.* (  0.166666667*LOG( (1.-y+y2)/(1.+2.*y+y2) ) +
     + 0.57735026*(ATAN( 0.57735026*(2.*y-1.) )+0.52359874) ) / y2

